{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "description": "OpenAI consumption and estimated spend. Token counts come from openai_tokens_total (labelled model / operation / direction); prices are NOT in the metric and are supplied by the dashboard variables at the top — edit them there when OpenAI changes its price list, never in this JSON.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 200,
      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### Prices are inputs, not facts\n\nEvery dollar figure on this dashboard is `tokens x price`, where **price comes from the dashboard variables above**, expressed as **USD per 1,000,000 tokens**. Defaults are the list prices for `gpt-4o-mini` (input `$0.15` / output `$0.60`) and `text-embedding-3-small` (`$0.02`). Change them in the variable boxes when OpenAI's pricing changes — no JSON edit, no redeploy.\n\nTwo things this cannot know:\n\n- **Only the two configured models are priced.** If `RESUME_PARSING_MODEL`, `QUERY_CONVERSION_MODEL` or `EMBEDDING_MODEL` is pointed at anything else, its tokens appear in the rate panels but contribute **$0.00** to spend. The *Tokens by model* table below exists to make that visible — any model in it that is not in the price variables is silently unpriced.\n- **Cached-prompt discounts, batch pricing and free tiers are not modelled.** Treat these numbers as an upper-bound estimate for alerting and capacity thinking, and the OpenAI billing console as the source of truth for what was actually charged.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 100,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Estimated spend",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Estimated OpenAI spend over the selected time range. Each term is wrapped in `or vector(0)` so a model with no traffic contributes zero instead of making the whole sum disappear.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 5 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 25 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "currencyUSD"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(\n    ((sum(increase(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"gpt-4o-mini.*\", direction=\"input\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) * $price_gpt4o_mini_in)\n  + ((sum(increase(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"gpt-4o-mini.*\", direction=\"output\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) * $price_gpt4o_mini_out)\n  + ((sum(increase(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"text-embedding-3-small.*\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)) * $price_embed_small)\n) / 1000000",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "spend",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Estimated spend in window",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Current burn rate extrapolated to 30 days, using the same prices. This is the number to compare against a monthly budget — it reacts within minutes of a traffic change, unlike a month-to-date total.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 20 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 100 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "currencyUSD"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(\n    ((sum(rate(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"gpt-4o-mini.*\", direction=\"input\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) * $price_gpt4o_mini_in)\n  + ((sum(rate(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"gpt-4o-mini.*\", direction=\"output\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) * $price_gpt4o_mini_out)\n  + ((sum(rate(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"text-embedding-3-small.*\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)) * $price_embed_small)\n) / 1000000 * 2592000",
          "legendFormat": "projected",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Projected spend / 30 days at current rate",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Where the money goes, split by the `operation` label: resume_parse (AI resume import), query_conversion (recruiter job description to structured query) and embedding (vector generation). resume_parse and query_conversion use a chat model and therefore have both input and output tokens; embedding is input-only.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": { "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false } },
          "decimals": 3,
          "mappings": [],
          "unit": "currencyUSD"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 5 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "displayLabels": ["name", "value"],
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "values": []
        },
        "pieType": "donut",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single", "sort": "none" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(\n    ((sum by (operation) (increase(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"gpt-4o-mini.*\", direction=\"input\"}[$__range]))) * $price_gpt4o_mini_in)\n  or\n    ((sum by (operation) (increase(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"text-embedding-3-small.*\"}[$__range]))) * $price_embed_small)\n) / 1000000",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} (input)",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "(sum by (operation) (increase(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\", model=~\"gpt-4o-mini.*\", direction=\"output\"}[$__range])) * $price_gpt4o_mini_out) / 1000000",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} (output)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Spend by operation (window)",
      "type": "piechart"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "id": 101,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Token consumption",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Token throughput broken out by every label openai_tokens_total carries: model, operation and direction (input|output). This is the raw signal the spend panels are derived from — if a dollar figure looks wrong, check here first for a model you did not expect.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "tokens/min",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 14, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["mean", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true,
          "sortBy": "Mean",
          "sortDesc": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (model, operation, direction) (rate(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} / {{operation}} / {{direction}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Token rate by model, operation and direction",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Total tokens per model and direction over the window. CHECK THIS TABLE whenever a model environment variable changes: any model listed here that is not covered by the price variables at the top of the dashboard is contributing real cost while showing $0.00 in the spend panels.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" },
            "inspect": false
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Tokens" },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": { "mode": "gradient", "type": "gauge" }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 10, "x": 14, "y": 12 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "countRows": false, "fields": "", "reducer": ["sum"], "show": true },
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "desc": true, "displayName": "Tokens" }]
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (model, direction) (increase(openai_tokens_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__range]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Tokens by model (window)",
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true },
            "indexByName": {},
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "Tokens",
              "direction": "Direction",
              "model": "Model"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "type": "table"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "id": 102,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Reliability and quotas",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Failed OpenAI calls as a share of all calls, per model and operation. openai_requests_total carries outcome=success|error. A sustained error rate on `embedding` means resumes are being queued but never becoming searchable; check the queue panels on the API health dashboard for the matching job failures.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "max": 100,
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 10 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "id": 6,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["mean", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * (\n  sum by (model, operation) (rate(openai_requests_total{job=~\"$job\", outcome=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval]))\n  /\n  clamp_min(sum by (model, operation) (rate(openai_requests_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])), 0.0000001)\n)",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} / {{operation}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "OpenAI error rate",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Requests turned away with a 429 by the per-user daily AI quota, by `operation` (resume_parse, recruiter_search). Defaults are 5 resume parses and 30 recruiter searches per user per day, and the quota is only enforced when AI_QUOTA_ENABLED is on (which defaults to NODE_ENV=production).\n\nRead this against the spend panels: rejections rising is the cost ceiling doing its job, but a persistently high number means real users are being blocked and the limit — or the pricing model — needs revisiting.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "normal" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "orange", "value": null }]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "id": 7,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["sum"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (operation) (increase(ai_quota_rejections_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "AI quota rejections (429)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "OpenAI call volume by operation, so an error-rate spike can be read as 'a few calls, all failing' or 'a lot of calls, some failing'.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "axisBorderShow": false,
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
            "axisLabel": "calls/min",
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "barAlignment": 0,
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "hideFrom": { "legend": false, "tooltip": false, "viz": false },
            "insertNulls": false,
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": { "group": "A", "mode": "none" },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "id": 8,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["mean", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum by (operation, outcome) (rate(openai_requests_total{job=~\"$job\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 60",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}} / {{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "OpenAI call rate by operation and outcome",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "preload": false,
  "refresh": "5m",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["crafthub", "ai", "cost", "openai"],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "description": "The Prometheus data source backing this stack. Pick your Grafana Cloud Prometheus instance on import.",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Data source",
        "multi": false,
        "name": "datasource",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "queryValue": "",
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "type": "datasource"
      },
      {
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "definition": "label_values(openai_requests_total, job)",
        "description": "Scrape job / OTel service. Leave on All unless several CraftHub deployments share one Prometheus tenant.",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Job",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "job",
        "options": [],
        "query": {
          "qryType": 1,
          "query": "label_values(openai_requests_total, job)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": { "text": "0.15", "value": "0.15" },
        "description": "USD per 1,000,000 INPUT (prompt) tokens for gpt-4o-mini. Used by resume_parse and query_conversion.",
        "hide": 0,
        "label": "gpt-4o-mini input $/1M",
        "name": "price_gpt4o_mini_in",
        "options": [{ "selected": true, "text": "0.15", "value": "0.15" }],
